{"id":"ec5f34b0092e1daf","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-L1.md","title":"L1 Space","display":"df-L1 — L1 Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-L1","aliases":["58-df-L1"],"display":"df-L1 — L1 Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-measure-space]]","[[58-df-measurable-function]]","[[58-df-integral]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-L1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-L1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-L1 — L1 Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"58-df-integral\">58-df-integral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal{F},\\mu)\">\\((X,\\mathcal{F},\\mu)\\)</span> (measure space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\)</span> (Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> (measure-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\)</span> (measurable-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntegrableFunction}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{IntegrableFunction}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> (integrable representative predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlmostEverywhereEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{AlmostEverywhereEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> (almost-everywhere equality defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AEClass}_S(C,f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{AEClass}_S(C,f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> (equivalence-class predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^1(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(L^1(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> (set of almost-everywhere equivalence classes)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}L1\\text{-}integrable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{IntegrableFunction}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\land\n\\int_X|f|\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}L1\\text{-}integrable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{IntegrableFunction}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\land\n\\int_X|f|\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}L1\\text{-}ae} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AlmostEverywhereEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\land\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(g;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\land\n\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\n\\mu\\bigl(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\}\\bigr)=0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}L1\\text{-}ae} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AlmostEverywhereEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\land\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(g;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\land\n\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\n\\mu\\bigl(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\}\\bigr)=0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}L1\\text{-}class} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AEClass}_S(C,f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{IntegrableFunction}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\nC=\\{g\\in\\mathbb C^X:\\mathrm{IntegrableFunction}_S(g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\n\\mathrm{AlmostEverywhereEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}L1\\text{-}class} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AEClass}_S(C,f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{IntegrableFunction}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\nC=\\{g\\in\\mathbb C^X:\\mathrm{IntegrableFunction}_S(g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\n\\mathrm{AlmostEverywhereEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}L1} \\vdash\nL^1(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\coloneqq\n\\{C\\in V:\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{AEClass}_S(C,f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}L1} \\vdash\nL^1(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\coloneqq\n\\{C\\in V:\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{AEClass}_S(C,f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The filename preserves the existing uppercase <code>L1</code> link target.</li>\n<li>Every representative used by the relation is measurable, so its disagreement set is measurable and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> is applied only inside its domain.</li>\n<li>The quotient is written extensionally as a set of equivalence classes rather than as an untyped quotient expression.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-integral","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"",